  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now reads the grouping callbacks over a materialized collection. orders.ToDictionary(o => o.Customer.Name) and the ToLookup/GroupBy/SelectMany/DistinctBy forms invoke their callback once per element, so a navigation read inside one is a per-element read that went unreported. Their results carry the entities onward, so the call still counts as an escape.",
